OL,3,GNEWSAMum took own life after injecting
OL,4,Achildren - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman took her own life after
OL,7,Finjecting insulin into her three
OL,8,Fchildren, one of whom later died, an
OL,9,Finquest has found.
OL,11,FThe woman, who cannot be named for
OL,12,Flegal reasons, died at the John
OL,13,FRadcliffe Hospital on 20 November,
OL,14,Fhaving been found unresponsive at her
OL,15,Fhome a month prior.
OL,17,FAn inquest at Oxford Coroner's Court
OL,18,Fheard the 49-year-old was going through
OL,19,Fcourt proceedings over the custody and
OL,20,Fresidence of her children with her
OL,21,Fex-husband.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
